---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const email = 'fasihuddin@live.com';
const linkedin = 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/fasih-ahmer';
const github = 'https://github.com/fbawithfasih';
const repo = 'https://github.com/fbawithfasih/portfolio';
---

<Base
  title="Fasihuddin Ahmer, Amazon account management and eCommerce"
  description="Account manager and eCommerce leader with 20+ years in client and vendor-facing roles, 7+ on Amazon vendor and seller businesses across the US, CA, MX and AU."
>
  <div class="page">
    <aside class="rail">
      <p class="name">Fasihuddin Ahmer</p>
      <p class="role">Account manager and eCommerce leader, Amazon vendor and seller businesses</p>

      <nav aria-label="Sections">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#work">Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
          <li><a href="#expertise">Expertise</a></li>
          <li><a href="#credentials">Credentials</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <ul class="contact">
        <li><a href={`mailto:${email}`}>Email</a></li>
        <li><a href={linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href={github} rel="me noopener">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="/Fasihuddin-Ahmer-Resume.pdf">Resume (PDF)</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="avail">Open to relocating to Bengaluru. Available for US shifts.</p>
    </aside>

    <main id="main">
      <header class="hero">
        <h1>I run Amazon vendor and seller businesses, and build the software that keeps them moving.</h1>

        <p class="lede">
          At Sound Around, one growth plan brought in <span class="mark" style="--i:0">$350K+ a month</span> in sales and
          sped up the liquidation of <span class="mark" style="--i:1">$20M+ of aged inventory</span>. I resolve
          <span class="mark" style="--i:2">80% of critical ASIN escalations within 24 hours</span>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have 20+ years in client and vendor-facing roles, 7+ of them on Amazon across the US, Canada, Mexico and
          Australia. I'm looking for account management and Amazon advertising roles where a vendor-side view of the AVS
          partnership counts.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/Fasihuddin-Ahmer-Resume.pdf">Download resume</a>
          <a class="button" href={`mailto:${email}`}>Email me</a>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="about" aria-label="About">
        <p>
          <strong>I see the AVS partnership from the vendor side.</strong> I manage 500+ ASINs on Vendor Central,
          250+ of them also on Seller Central, and work directly with Amazon's AVS account manager and vendor managers
          on business planning, escalations, annual terms, co-op, margin and chargebacks. I've done joint business
          planning with founders, directors and Amazon vendor managers.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>I run growth and clearance as one plan.</strong> Pricing, promotions and merchandising move together:
          Best Deals, Lightning Deals, Prime Exclusive Deals, coupons, Prime Day and BFCM. On
          <span class="mark">$40K+ a month</span> of ad spend with Perpetua bidding, that discipline delivered
          <span class="mark">8x ROAS</span> with <span class="mark">TACOS below 10%</span>.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>I build the tools I need.</strong> A Google Sheets repricing dashboard that pulls API data for all
          500+ SKUs, reporting and ASIN diagnostic tools on SP-API and Ads API, and AMAIOP, a SaaS platform for Amazon
          analytics and ad optimization. I build them with Claude Code.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-h">
        <h2 id="work-h">Work</h2>

        <article class="entry">
          <div class="when">Jan 2025 to present</div>
          <div>
            <h3>eCommerce Sales Manager</h3>
            <p class="where">Sound Around Inc., remote from India for a US company</p>
            <p>
              I manage 500+ ASINs across NutriChef, Pyle, SereneLife, Pure Clean and Lanzar. The growth plan I
              identified and executed generates <span class="mark">$350K+ a month</span> in sales and accelerates the
              clearance of <span class="mark">$20M+</span> in aged inventory, $12M of it past 365 days. The Board of
              Directors and the Director of eCommerce recognized the work.
            </p>
            <p>
              I clear listing suppressions, variation errors and policy issues through Vendor Central cases, vendor
              manager escalations and AVS channels. I lead promotion planning for Prime Day and BFCM, negotiate annual
              terms with Amazon, and deliver a weekly business plan to the founders: SKU-level actions, blockers,
              decisions needed and next-week priorities. I wrote the SOPs for inventory clearance, campaign guardrails
              and promotion timing, and I mentor two direct reports.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="entry">
          <div class="when">Jun 2019 to present, part-time since Jan 2025</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Co-founder and head of account management</h3>
            <p class="where">Hive Mind Nestor, Amazon SPN and Ads Verified Partner, Agra</p>
            <p>
              I managed 14 client accounts across the US, CA, MX and AU marketplaces, owning the relationship, growth
              strategy and commercial discussions. Clients stayed: <span class="mark">90%+ satisfaction</span>, an
              <span class="mark">80% renewal rate</span> and a 24-month average tenure, with a
              <span class="mark">40% increase</span> in recurring sales.
            </p>
            <p>
              I built Queenza Crafts' Amazon business from business plan to product selection, launch, PPC, logistics
              and trademark registration, reaching <span class="mark">$200K+ a year</span> in revenue at a 30% net
              margin. Demand forecasting ahead of Prime Day and BFCM cut stockouts by 40%, and I kept ACOS under 20%
              at 4.5+ ROAS on $8K+ monthly budgets. I led a team of 10 account executives and PPC specialists.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="entry">
          <div class="when">2003 to 2019</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Earlier in sales and operations</h3>
            <p class="where">Education, training and IT channel businesses, India</p>
            <p>
              I co-founded Arisetotal Innovative Education, opened 4 franchise centres in 3 months and grew enrollment
              40% year on year. Before that I founded a corporate training business and ran branches at Frankfinn, HCL
              Infosystems (20 direct reports, Best Branch Manager 2012) and ICFAI Group, after sales roles at Sahara
              Computers and Samsung Electronics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <section id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-h">
        <h2 id="projects-h">Projects</h2>
        <ul class="projects">
          <li>
            <h3>AMAIOP</h3>
            <p>
              A SaaS platform for Amazon seller analytics and advertising optimization, built on SP-API and Ads API
              with Claude Code.
            </p>
            <p class="meta">Amazon SP-API, Ads API, Keepa, Claude. Runs on Railway and Cloudflare.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>eseller360</h3>
            <p>An Etsy seller SaaS that syncs listings and orders, reports analytics and handles webhooks.</p>
            <p class="meta">TypeScript. Private repository.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/fbawithfasih/hive-mind-ad-optimizer">hive-mind-ad-optimizer</a></h3>
            <p>An advertising optimization tool from the Hive Mind Nestor toolkit.</p>
            <p class="meta">JavaScript. Public repository.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3><a href="https://github.com/fbawithfasih/Sangemarmar-VTS">Sangemarmar VTS</a></h3>
            <p>
              A vehicle entry, sales and commission management system for The Sangemarmar, with a NestJS and
              PostgreSQL backend and a Flutter mobile app.
            </p>
            <p class="meta">NestJS, PostgreSQL, Flutter, Docker. Public repository.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Vendor cost and repricing dashboard</h3>
            <p>
              A Google Sheets dashboard that pulls API data for all 500+ SKUs at Sound Around and turns pricing
              decisions into a repeatable routine.
            </p>
            <p class="meta">Google Sheets, API automation. Internal tool.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="expertise" aria-labelledby="expertise-h">
        <h2 id="expertise-h">Expertise</h2>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div>
            <dt>Vendor and account management</dt>
            <dd>Joint business planning, QBRs, annual terms, co-op and margin negotiation, escalation management, vendor satisfaction and retention.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Promotions and catalog</dt>
            <dd>Best Deals, Lightning Deals, Prime Exclusive Deals, VPC, coupons, A+ content, variations, browse nodes, bulk flat-file uploads, Brand Registry.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Advertising</dt>
            <dd>Sponsored Products, Brands and Display, Amazon DSP, Amazon Marketing Cloud, Perpetua, ACOS, TACOS and ROAS optimization, A/B testing.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Analytics</dt>
            <dd>Amazon Retail Analytics, KPI dashboards, weekly business reviews, advanced Excel, SQL, Google Sheets API automation.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Leadership and process</dt>
            <dd>Teams of up to 20, 100+ people onboarded, SOPs and playbooks, automation with Claude Code and Claude Cowork on SP-API and Ads API.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Platforms</dt>
            <dd>Vendor Central, Seller Central, Helium10, SellerSprite, Keepa, Goflow, Asana, Slack, Walmart, eBay, Etsy, Target, Macy's.</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section id="credentials" aria-labelledby="credentials-h">
        <h2 id="credentials-h">Credentials</h2>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div>
            <dt>Education</dt>
            <dd>
              Post Graduate Program in Data Analytics, Purdue University Online (in progress). MBA in Sales and
              Marketing, EIILM University. Advanced Certificate in Digital Marketing and Communication, MICA. BSc in
              Mathematics, Statistics and Economics, Dr. B.R. Ambedkar University.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Amazon Ads</dt>
            <dd>Amazon Marketing Cloud Foundations, Amazon DSP, Sponsored Ads Advanced, Sponsored Ads, Ads Campaign Optimization, Ads for Retail Advanced, Ads for Retail.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Other</dt>
            <dd>SQL for Data Analytics and Business Analytics with Excel (Simplilearn), Freedom Ticket 3.0 (Helium10), Generative AI Mastermind (GrowthSchool).</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-h" class="contact-block">
        <h2 id="contact-h">Contact</h2>
        <p>The fastest way to reach me is email.</p>
        <p><a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a></p>
        <p>
          <a href={linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a>, <a href={github} rel="me noopener">GitHub</a> and my
          agency site, <a href="https://www.hivemindnestor.com/">Hive Mind Nestor</a>.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/Fasihuddin-Ahmer-Resume.pdf">Download resume</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <p>Built with Astro and hosted on Cloudflare Pages.</p>
        <p><a href={repo}>Source on GitHub</a></p>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>
